  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>About Northern Noggin:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Born in the heart of Alaska's breathtaking landscape, we forge premium apparel for those who crave the wild.&nbsp; Imagine the feeling of crisp mountain air whipping through your hair, the whisper of snow crunching underfoot, and the warmth of shared laughter echoing off glaciers. Our luxuriously soft merino wool beanies started it all, but we've evolved.&nbsp; We craft high-end hoodies that are as comfortable as they are stylish, baseball caps that add a touch of rugged chic to any outfit, and soon, a full arsenal of apparel designed to conquer the elements and turn heads along the way.&nbsp; Come explore with us, push your boundaries, and experience the unparalleled comfort and style of Northern Noggin. Let your clothes tell your story of adventure, and feel the Alaskan spirit ignite your every step.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Product description:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Forget your average sweatshirt. This storm blue heavyweight sweatshirt is crafted for those who love &amp; appreciate the finer things in life. It's an experience in pure comfort.&nbsp; It's luxurious 10oz fleece blend delivers warmth without weight.&nbsp; This is the sweatshirt you'll want to live in, whether you're running errands, embarking on adventures, or lounging at home.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><b>Designed for Comfort and Style</b></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">The 1x1 ribbed cuffs and waistband ensure a perfect comfortable fit that stays true, wash after wash. The custom design flatters any body type and offers room for movement and layering.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp; The s</span>plit stitch double-needle sewing and twill neck tape elevates this piece beyond loungewear, creating a clean, structured look.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Details:</span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">10 oz./yd&sup2; (330gm)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">70/30 ring-spun cotton/polyester 3-end fleece</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Split stitch double-needle sewing on all seams</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Twill neck tape</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">1x1 ribbing at cuff and waistband</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Payment terms:</strong></p>\r\n<div class=\"additional-term-container\">\r\n<div id=\"additional_term_value\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">You will get a 10% commission on total referral sales when a customer makes a purchase through your affiliate link or uses your coupon code.</span></div>\r\n</div>",
